  "description": "<p>This personalized teacher welcome doormat creates a warm and cheerful entrance for any classroom. Featuring a unique Composition Notebook Style, it offers a special touch with customization options for a teacher's name. It's designed to be a welcoming and functional addition, perfect for greeting students.</p>\n<h3>Product Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Personalize with the teacher's name for a unique classroom touch.</li>\n<li>Soft non-woven fabric top provides comfort.</li>\n<li>Non-slip neoprene rubber backing ensures stability.</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime to keep floors clean.</li>\n<li>Versatile for both indoor and outdoor classroom use.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style Name</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Material &amp; Care</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Back Material Type</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Avoid bleaching</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Where It Works</h3>\n<p>This doormat is ideal for classrooms, entryways, and RVs, offering a welcoming touch in various educational and personal spaces. Its durable design makes it suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings, ensuring functionality wherever it is placed.</p>",
